ErnestREDAs:
REDA [6,2] 0x0 1 0x0 30
REDA [6,3] 0x0 1 0x0 0

ErnestAppears:
EVBIT_T 9
SOUN 0xD8
LOAD1 1 ErnestBlock
ENUN
SVAL s1 0x14
SET_HP Ernest
SetBadStatus(Ernest,0x1)
CUMO Ernest
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x919)
SVAL s1 0x00040000
CHAI CityGuardFighter
SVAL s1 0x00040000
CHAI CityGuardKnight
NoFade
ENDA

BigBrawl:
EVBIT_T 9
LOAD1 0 RaiderGroup
ENUN
STAL 10
LOAD1 0 RaiderGroup2
ENUN
CUMO [2,11]
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x920)
NoFade
ENDA

