NavarroConvo:
MUSC 0x31
Text(0x923)
ENUT $03
CALL Ch1EndingScene
NoFade
ENDA

RecruitErnest:
MUSS 0x30
Text(0x9CC)
SetToPursue(Ernest)
SetUnitStatus(Ernest, BadStatusType, 0)
SetUnitStatus(Ernest, BadStatusTurn, 0)
REVEAL Ernest
CUSA Ernest
NoFade
ENDA

AltoSupply:
MUSI
Text(0x91C)
MUNO
SVAL s3 0x09
GIVEITEMTO Daphne
NoFade
ENDA

KanSupply:
MUSI
Text(0x921)
MUNO
SVAL s3 0x6C //change this to whatever the strawberry jam is
GIVEITEMTO Daphne
NoFade
ENDA

HandAxeHouse:
MUSI
SetBackground(0x0)
Text(0x91B)
EndConvo
MUNO
SVAL s3 0x28
GIVEITEMTO 0xFFFF
TILECHANGE 0x2
NoFade
ENDA

InnConvo:
MUSI
SetBackground(0x9)
Text(0x91A)
EndConvo
NoFade
ENDA

ch1Armory:
SHLI IronSword IronLance Javelin IronAxe IronBow
BYTE 0 0 0 0
ALIGN 4

ch1Shop:
SHLI Gust Fire Heal Vulnerary Antitoxin DoorKey
BYTE 0 0 0 0
ALIGN 4

NowTalkToNavarro:
ENUF $0C
NoFade
ENDA

Ch1BeginningScene:
ENUT $0C
LOAD1 0 MainEnemy
ENUN
LOAD1 0 MainEnemy2
ENUN
CAM1 [14,15]
STAL 10
FADU 16
STAL 30
LOAD1 1 DaphneParty
ENUN
CUMO Daphne
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x910)
EndConvo
EVBIT_T 9
STAL 5
CUMO [11,14]
STAL 60
CURE
MoveByCoords(60, 11, 14, 12, 17)
ENUN
Text(0x912)
CAM1 [9,14]
MoveByCoords(60, 9, 13, 12, 16)
ENUN
Text(0x913)
STAL 10
MoveByCoords(60, 12, 16, 11, 7)
ENUN
MUSC 0x2E
SetBackground(0x5)
Text(0x914)
EndConvo
STAL 30
CAM1 Daphne
Text(0x911)
STAL 30
MUSC 0x25 //Tension, currently
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x915)
EndConvo
CUMO Daphne
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x91E)
EndConvo
STAL 10
EVBIT_F 9
CAM1 [3,9]
STAL 10
LOAD1 1 AltoParty
ENUN
CUMO Alto
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x5)
Text(0x91F)
EndConvo
NoFade
ENDA

Ch1EndingScene:
FADI 16
CLEN Navarro
CLEA Daphne
CLEE Warren
CAM1 [11,3]
FADU 20
STAL 60
SetBackground(0xF)
CHECK_EXISTS Ernest
BNE 1 sC s0 //if Ernest is alive, jump to LABEL 1, otherwise keep reading
Text(0x938) //dead
GOTO 3
LABEL 1
CHECK_ALLEGIANCE Ernest
BEQ 2 sC s0 // if Ernest is allied, jump to LABEL 2, otherwise keep reading
Text(0x91D) //alive but not allied
GOTO 3
LABEL 2
Text(0x937) //alive and allied
LABEL 3
MNC2 Ch2
ENDA

MESSAGE Events end at offset CURRENTOFFSET